            <ArticleTitle>[Osteoid osteoma in the differential diagnosis of knee pain in athletes].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>65-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We report on a 24-year old recreational sportswoman who is suffering on a knee pain after taking part in sports involving strength. The diagnosis of an osteoid osteoma was established. Diagnostic and therapeutic possibilities are presented.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
